        "created_at": "2012-11-19T15:03:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I love the art of Sentinels of the Multiverse.</p><p>I especially love the art prints (that are now on my wall). I'm just sad I missed out on the original 3 art prints from the first edition :(.</p><p>SO, I hope we do get the 150l needed so we can get more art prints!</p><p>How do you guys show off your stuff?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/4/4fa3198719cd68e64839a86f138a432984d4d97d.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_20121118_160808_0.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"bmv9TSLAAF1biJP55jlBTMmbdgx\" width=\"324\" height=\"243\"></p>",
